 n\nPerson1’s Yahrzeit begins at sundown on Friday\, April 29 and continu
 es until sundown on the day of observance. It is customary to light a memo
 rial candle before sundown as the Yahrzeit begins.\n\nMay your loved one
 ’s soul be bound up in the bond of eternal life and may their memory ser
 ve as a continued source of inspiration and comfort to you.
END:VEVENT
